  "reading": {
    "zh": "自下而上：block 是最底的块设备抽象，identity 给它贴身份，fs 在其上实现 inode/目录/块分配，vfs 提供路径式门面，rwlock 负责并发；volume 把多块盘组合成带冗余的卷；vector/log/logging 是块设备上的数据服务；datadisk+wal+checkpoint 组成事务性容器；driver 与 fuse 是挂载与宿主接入。",
    "en": "Bottom-up: block is the raw device abstraction, identity labels it, fs implements inodes/directories/block allocation on top, vfs exposes a path-based facade and rwlock handles concurrency; volume combines disks into redundant volumes; vector/log/logging are data services over block devices; datadisk+wal+checkpoint form the transactional container; driver and fuse attach it to hosts."
  },
